g out of short-form feeds while keeping normal chats, payments, search, long-form videos, and DMs working\n- Asymmetric cooldown enforcement: enabling any feed lock is instant, while turning off an active feed lock requires the 15-minute monotonic cooldown or a Friend/Parent Unlock Code, and every auto-exit is recorded in Blocked Today stats\n- Slimmed 64-bit (`arm64-v8a`) APK & multi-CDN update fallback: reduced APK size from 52.3 MB to 8.6 MB (8,986,421 bytes) and added same-origin Fastly CDN fallback for in-app updates\n\nversionCode: 17\nsha256: 27544ece72f551d40023ab1c0815dde4feee29e2e448f7a36315ba2a31cc9ad8\n"}